CONVERSATION

Three read-only globals hold this chat's conversation. Live in image, persist
across turns, grow as each message lands:
- `conversation` full ordered transcript. List of messages, each alist with
  keys "role" and "content" (strings). Role is "user", "assistant", "system"
  or "tool". Rejected step's tool message also has "problems": list of alists
  with "line" and "message". Read field: (cdr (assoc "content" (car conversation))).
- `user-messages` list of user's message strings.
- `assistant-messages` list of your own earlier message strings.
Search or pull earlier content, e.g.
(mapcar (lambda (m) (cdr (assoc "content" m))) conversation).
READ-ONLY: setq on them errors. To keep changed value, bind own variable with
let or setq under other name.
